<title>UK: CSFB prices two-tranche bond for Household CCMT.</title>
<headline>CSFB prices two-tranche bond for Household CCMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD AFFINITY CREDIT CARD MASTER TRUST 1</p>
<p>		SERIES 1997-1</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
